<h2>How the case travelled</h2>
<div class="flow">
  <div class="fstep"><strong>1989 / 1993.</strong> The appellants join the Legal Metrology Department, Raipur, as Class-IV employees; they are promoted to Assistant Grade-III in 2012&ndash;2013 and regularised in 2015.</div>
